{"3392560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Witherwood", "steam_appid": 3392560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The forest is alive. It is watching you. And it is corrupted.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don’t just survive in Witherwood; you <strong>adapt or die</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the wilderness mutates, so do you. Shape your body into something stronger, faster; but far less human. Every gain comes at a cost. The deeper you go, the more your mind begins to fracture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not everything you see is real.... </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stave off insanity…. lest what you see kills you.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/ee3b81b8ef0c6b30f19567f08ea039e7.poster.avif?t=1787006765\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/ee3b81b8ef0c6b30f19567f08ea039e7.webm?t=1787006765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/ee3b81b8ef0c6b30f19567f08ea039e7.mp4?t=1787006765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mutate to Survive</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the corruption spreading through the forest and evolve your body into powerful forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the shape of a <strong>Bear</strong> - slow, unstoppable, devastating</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take flight on<strong> Raven</strong> wings - evade, hunt, strike with precission</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/de6aa7c92f2bb0de25157a06f6202174.poster.avif?t=1787006765\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/de6aa7c92f2bb0de25157a06f6202174.webm?t=1787006765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/de6aa7c92f2bb0de25157a06f6202174.mp4?t=1787006765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace <strong>fungal or insectoid mutations</strong> - alien, unpredictable, deadly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a <strong>Wolf</strong> - fast, relentless, built to hunt</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/29f404f1a58cb40849f8c44d20d1931d.poster.avif?t=1787006765\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/29f404f1a58cb40849f8c44d20d1931d.webm?t=1787006765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/29f404f1a58cb40849f8c44d20d1931d.mp4?t=1787006765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stomp monstrous insects with the <strong>Pine Mutation</strong> - Strong, regenerative, unbreakable</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/6ecb791e5368e4e201580603b2355876.poster.avif?t=1787006765\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/6ecb791e5368e4e201580603b2355876.webm?t=1787006765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/6ecb791e5368e4e201580603b2355876.mp4?t=1787006765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mutation changes how you fight, move, and survive. <br>You are not building a character, you are <strong>becoming something else</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/1131b0ba6500efdb2939aa102998a210.poster.avif?t=1787006765\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/1131b0ba6500efdb2939aa102998a210.webm?t=1787006765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/1131b0ba6500efdb2939aa102998a210.mp4?t=1787006765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in a versatile combat system. Jump, roll, block attacks, imbue your weapons with poison; each equipment impacts the game and combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/eb2dddb50ed9dcdeb86b7701dcfc6bc7.poster.avif?t=1787006765\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/eb2dddb50ed9dcdeb86b7701dcfc6bc7.webm?t=1787006765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/eb2dddb50ed9dcdeb86b7701dcfc6bc7.mp4?t=1787006765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD, CRAFT, ENDURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To last another night, you’ll need more than strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources from a hostile, changing world. Build shelter to protect yourself from what’s outside.... and inside. Craft weapons, tools, and gear to stay alive. Preparation is the only thing standing between you and collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/d22003329bfd957eed645cf08eefb4d6.poster.avif?t=1787006765\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/d22003329bfd957eed645cf08eefb4d6.webm?t=1787006765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/d22003329bfd957eed645cf08eefb4d6.mp4?t=1787006765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow Stronger, But at a cost</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up, refine your approach, and choose how far you’re willing to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power makes survival easier.<br>But it also pulls you further from what you were.<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The forest is alive. It is watching you. And it is corrupted.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don’t just survive in Witherwood; you <strong>adapt or die</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the wilderness mutates, so do you. Shape your body into something stronger, faster; but far less human. Every gain comes at a cost. The deeper you go, the more your mind begins to fracture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not everything you see is real.... </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stave off insanity…. lest what you see kills you.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/ee3b81b8ef0c6b30f19567f08ea039e7.poster.avif?t=1787006765\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/ee3b81b8ef0c6b30f19567f08ea039e7.webm?t=1787006765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/ee3b81b8ef0c6b30f19567f08ea039e7.mp4?t=1787006765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mutate to Survive</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the corruption spreading through the forest and evolve your body into powerful forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the shape of a <strong>Bear</strong> - slow, unstoppable, devastating</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take flight on<strong> Raven</strong> wings - evade, hunt, strike with precission</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/de6aa7c92f2bb0de25157a06f6202174.poster.avif?t=1787006765\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/de6aa7c92f2bb0de25157a06f6202174.webm?t=1787006765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/de6aa7c92f2bb0de25157a06f6202174.mp4?t=1787006765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace <strong>fungal or insectoid mutations</strong> - alien, unpredictable, deadly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a <strong>Wolf</strong> - fast, relentless, built to hunt</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/29f404f1a58cb40849f8c44d20d1931d.poster.avif?t=1787006765\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/29f404f1a58cb40849f8c44d20d1931d.webm?t=1787006765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/29f404f1a58cb40849f8c44d20d1931d.mp4?t=1787006765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stomp monstrous insects with the <strong>Pine Mutation</strong> - Strong, regenerative, unbreakable</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/6ecb791e5368e4e201580603b2355876.poster.avif?t=1787006765\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/6ecb791e5368e4e201580603b2355876.webm?t=1787006765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/6ecb791e5368e4e201580603b2355876.mp4?t=1787006765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mutation changes how you fight, move, and survive. <br>You are not building a character, you are <strong>becoming something else</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/1131b0ba6500efdb2939aa102998a210.poster.avif?t=1787006765\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/1131b0ba6500efdb2939aa102998a210.webm?t=1787006765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/1131b0ba6500efdb2939aa102998a210.mp4?t=1787006765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in a versatile combat system. Jump, roll, block attacks, imbue your weapons with poison; each equipment impacts the game and combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/eb2dddb50ed9dcdeb86b7701dcfc6bc7.poster.avif?t=1787006765\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/eb2dddb50ed9dcdeb86b7701dcfc6bc7.webm?t=1787006765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/eb2dddb50ed9dcdeb86b7701dcfc6bc7.mp4?t=1787006765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD, CRAFT, ENDURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To last another night, you’ll need more than strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources from a hostile, changing world. Build shelter to protect yourself from what’s outside.... and inside. Craft weapons, tools, and gear to stay alive. Preparation is the only thing standing between you and collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/d22003329bfd957eed645cf08eefb4d6.poster.avif?t=1787006765\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/d22003329bfd957eed645cf08eefb4d6.webm?t=1787006765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/extras/d22003329bfd957eed645cf08eefb4d6.mp4?t=1787006765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow Stronger, But at a cost</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up, refine your approach, and choose how far you’re willing to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power makes survival easier.<br>But it also pulls you further from what you were.<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Mutate to survive, or lose your mind trying. In this open-world survival horror, the forest changes you as much as you change it. Evolve into monstrous forms, build and craft to endure, and manage a slipping sanity where hallucinations become lethal.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/3503e5dc3ba1b46f681ff0b62a4e2d705f746192/header.jpg?t=1787006765", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/44c9c18f5da72ddac20aa069c8be9c03789249c6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787006765", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392560/44c9c18f5da72ddac20aa069c8be9c03789249c6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787006765", "website": "https://witherwood.app/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</st